ColorPicker redisplay font-resource contract (2026-10-25)
============================================================

- Read the font selected by the live ColorPicker GC before querying its
  metrics. Passing the GC context ID as a font ID raised `BadFont` during
  redisplay on servers with independent X11 resource namespaces. The focused
  installed consumer now requests an expose and fails on any asynchronous X
  error; see `docs/color-picker-redisplay-guard.md`.

