Publication and acceptance policy (2026-10-24)
====================================================================

Bug fixes require relevant passing automated regression tests before publication.
Record accepted fixes here and update relevant docs/ pages. Commit and push
accepted fixes to both rpi4 and GitHub independently of consuming applications'
gates, development phases or dependency pins. See AGENTS.md for the full policy.
This policy entry does not assert acceptance of unfinished source changes.

