  output storage, and check child-count multiplication before allocation.
- Guard `XmContainerReorder` integer-list allocation and extend the Container
  regression documentation.

Development 2.4.0 / DropDown selection-table bounds
===================================================

- Check converted DropDown selected-item counts before allocating temporary
  XmString tables, preserving the existing selection-error behavior on
  unrepresentable sizes.
- Add a public DropDown regression and documentation.

Development 2.4.0 / DropDown localized text positions
=====================================================

